The Castle is not too difficult if you take a bit care.
First check, ESP-blindfolded; are there purple L's on
the level. If yes you should have MR and/or a permanent
engraver. Otherwise, with a music instrument, you can
safely perform the drawbridge guillotine to dispatch
most of the critters. (Don't be too close to the
drawbridge, to avoid being killed by an applied wand
of striking. And don't get drowned.)

Level is not that important for the Castle, equipment
is.

A hostile titan at Medusa is also something to avoid.

